              <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>土地造成</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="BlankCell"><text:p>　</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="BlankCell"><text:p>　</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
              <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>建築物又は工作物</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="BlankCell"><text:p>　</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="BlankCell"><text:p>　</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
              <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>計</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="BlankCell"><text:p>　</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="BlankCell"><text:p>　</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
            </table:table>
            <text:p text:style-name="Head">３　権利を「　　　」しようとする契約の内容</text:p>
            <table:table table:name="Contract" table:style-name="Grid"><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>区分　売買　贈与　交換　賃貸借　使用貸借</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>時期（賃借期間）　対価（賃借料）m²当たり　円（総額　円）　対価（賃借料）の支払方法・時期　その他（特記事項）</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="BlankCell"><text:p>　</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="BlankCell"><text:p>　</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table>
